      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay fine but if i absolutely cannot go to a doctor right now what should i do instead? can i at least use hot compresses to try and get it to come to a head so it drains naturally? or is there like an antiseptic cream or something i can put on it to kill the infection so i don't have to deal with it?",
